FFmpeg 0.6.7 (H.264 decoder subset) in RetroTele
================================================

What: the H.264 video decoder of FFmpeg 0.6.7 (libavcodec + the parts of libavutil it needs),
C only, used by native/h264dec (h264dec.lib) to show the other person's video in Telegram calls
on the Nokia N79.

Source: https://ffmpeg.org/releases/ffmpeg-0.6.7.tar.bz2
        sha256 67a0cf9d8b90b0a212412a99b508b8c4ea3f7d9ddce8445701dc432cf643878e
        (git: https://git.ffmpeg.org/ffmpeg.git, tag n0.6.7)

